ime in the lower-dimensional Einstein frame while satisfying higher-dimensional energy conditions, when that frame condition is imposed only after integration over the compact space?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0041"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:da78d9491ae912a4f92363ba0cfd288e6f5945fe0dd6fe2d4492753e030f7383","title":"Do geodesics from exotic finite-distance pseudo-hybrid limits toward large volume satisfy the refined swampland distance conjecture (RSDC), including examples arising from non-abelian GLSMs?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0042"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:da448c6bdc13a34a5e52973f6892cb75a1cd0d0e644cc3d8a44b0b92d4c91850","title":"How do power-law curvature corrections affect scalar criteria and cosmological behavior? The paper treats epsilon as a theory parameter and separately expands near the General Relativity value epsilon=0.","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0042"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:daa7eb7f6a86e612633d818ecf1fcae97da1ac72666ca5350f1e2baf1b4ffcb3","title":"Do forward-amplitude positivity and improved positivity constrain the first higher-derivative Wilson coefficients of Higgs-Dilaton inflation strongly enough to conflict with its phenomenological parameter region?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0042"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:daec1a59347fea16d441e2fc637b9da62976be0979319883b3d1b75e7d55b323","title":"Do non-supersymmetric AdS vacua of dyonic ISO(7) maximal supergravity that are perturbatively stable within D = 4 develop brane-jet instabilities after uplift to massive IIA, or decay through domain walls?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0052"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:daa93bf3e268c461507acb1d21caf9bfe1246193cb4